\caption{The arrows show recorded support links, not proof dependencies. The audit checks both listed supports even where their mathematical roles overlap. The support hypothesis still needs explanation. The false paraphrase is illustrative, distinct from historical edit~8 in Table~\ref{tab:mutations}.}
\label{fig:theorem}
